  {
   "description": "<p>\n    To make sure your photo is accepted, please follow these simple steps. \n    Think of it as presenting yourself in a respectful and professional way.\n  </p>\n  <ul>\n    <li>Use a plain white background so your face is clear and easy to see.</li>\n    <li>Kindly remove your glasses \u2014 we want your eyes to be visible without reflection.</li>\n    <li>Keep a calm, formal expression. A gentle smile is fine, but avoid showing teeth.</li>\n    <li>For men: please do not wear hats or head coverings.</li>\n    <li>For women: a headscarf (tudung) is welcome and encouraged.</li>\n  </ul>\n  <p>\n    These guidelines are here to help you \u2014 following them ensures your application \n    goes smoothly without delays. Thank you for taking the time to prepare your photo carefully.\n  </p>",
